00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:26.820
Marukawa publishing glossary!

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:28.610
Today's word is Maruakawa's
Marketing Department!

00:23:28.610 --> 00:23:31.000
The marketing department
is the place where all...

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:32.850
...the sales and circulation is managed.

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:34.960
They have so much power that
there are rumors about...

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:37.230
...not pissing them off if you
want your book published.

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:38.730
It's almost advised that you make friends with them

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:40.730
and the editorial staff if you want to make it in this business.
